       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-GFM-DEPLOY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GFM-DEPLOY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PIPELINE-STREAM-SYNC-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HOGAN-BANK-ENDOWMENT-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-USDA-ANIM-WARP-SOUND     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SUBPOENA-RECALL-AUTH-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GFM-DEPLOY-SOVEREIGN-SEAL PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DEPLOY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DEPLOY-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DEPLOY-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-STREAM-AND-ENDOW.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-ANIM-AND-RECALL.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-DEPLOY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-STREAM-AND-ENDOW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PIPELINE-STREAM-SYNC-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HOGAN-BANK-ENDOWMENT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-ANIM-AND-RECALL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-USDA-ANIM-WARP-SOUND.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SUBPOENA-RECALL-AUTH-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-DEPLOY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PIPELINE-STREAM-SYNC-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HOGAN-BANK-ENDOWMENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-USDA-ANIM-WARP-SOUND = 1 AND
              WS-SUBPOENA-RECALL-AUTH-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GFM-DEPLOY-SOVEREIGN-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DEPLOY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DEPLOY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DEPLOY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DEPLOY-CODE.
